    "text": "\u00deunche\u00fe \u00feet \u00feu hire.\nGet s\u00e6i\u00fe \u00feeo sowle soriliche to \u00feen licame, ne \u00feearft \u00feu on stirope stonden mid fotan, on nenne\nNu mon m\u00e6i seggen bi \u00fee, \u00fees mon is iwiten nu her, weila, ond his weol\u00e6n beo\u00fe her bel\u00e6fed.\nNolde he nefre \u00fe\u00e6rof don his drihtenes wille.\nAc \u00e6fre \u00feu g\u00e6deredest g\u00e6rsume on \u00feine feonde.\nNulle\u00fe heo nimen gete, hwo hit bigete.\nNafst \u00feu bute weilawei \u00feet \u00feu weole heuedest.\nAl is reowliche \u00fein si\u00fe efter \u00fein wrecche lif.\n\u00deeo men beo\u00fe \u00fee bli\u00fere, \u00fee arisen \u00e6r wi\u00fe \u00fee, \u00feet \u00fein mu\u00fe is betuned, \u00fee \u00feu \u00feeo teone ut lettest, \u00fee\nDea\u00fe hine haue\u00fe bituned ond \u00feene teone aleid.\nSo\u00fe is iseid on \u00feen salmebec, Os tuum habundauit malitia, was on \u00feine mu\u00fee lu\u00feernesse ripe.\nNoldest \u00feu on \u00feine huse herborwen \u00feeo wrecchen, ne mihten heo under \u00feine roue none reste finden.\nNoldest \u00feu nefre helpen \u00feam orlease wrecchen, ac \u00feu sete on \u00feine benche, underleid mid \u00feine bolstre,\nNe icneowe \u00feu \u00fee sulfen, \u00feet \u00feu scoldest mid wurmen wunien in eor\u00fean.\nNu \u00feu hauest neowe hus, inne be\u00ferungen, lowe beo\u00fe \u00fee helewowes, unheige beo\u00fe \u00fee sidwowes, \u00fein\nColde is \u00fee ibedded, clo\u00fees bideled.\nNulle\u00fe \u00feine hinen clo\u00fees \u00fee senden, for heom \u00feunche\u00fe al to lut, \u00feet \u00feu heom bilefdest; \u00feet \u00feu hefdest\n\u00deus is iwitan \u00fein weole, wendest \u00feet hit \u00fein were.\n\u00deus is nu \u00fein si\u00fe efter \u00fein wrecche lif.\n\u00dee sculen nu waxen wurmes be siden, \u00feeo hungrie feond, \u00feeo \u00fee freten wulle\u00fe.\nHeo wulle\u00fe \u00fee frecliche freten, for heom \u00fein fl\u00e6sc like\u00fe.\nHeo wulle\u00fe freten \u00fein fule hold, \u00feeo hwule heo hit finde\u00fe.\n\u00deonne hit al bi\u00fe agon, heo wulle\u00fe gnawen \u00feine bon, \u00feeo orlease wurmes.\nHeo winde\u00fe on \u00fein armes, heo breke\u00fe \u00feine breoste ond borie\u00fe \u00feurh ofer al.\nHeo reowe\u00fe in ond ut, \u00feet hord is hore owen.\nOnd so heo wulle\u00fe waden wide in \u00feine wombe, todelen \u00feine \u00feermes, \u00feeo \u00fee deore weren, lifre ond \u00feine\nOnd so scal formelten mawe ond \u00fein milte, ond so scal \u00fein.",
